hings under a car that turn when it moves."},{"id":"tyre","word":"tyre","pin":[470,654],"box":[412,644,116,116],"level":"A2","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈtaɪə","pos":"noun","ex":"We had a flat tyre on the way home.","us":"tire","def":"The thick rubber ring around a wheel."},{"id":"headlights","word":"headlights","pin":[1040,601],"box":[1022,584,38,30],"level":"A2","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈhedlaɪts","pos":"noun","ex":"Turn on your headlights - it's getting dark.","def":"The big lights at the front of a car."},{"id":"indicator","word":"indicator","pin":[1056,623],"box":[1048,614,16,18],"level":"B1","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈɪndɪkeɪtə","pos":"noun","ex":"He turned left without using his indicator.","us":"turn signal","def":"A small flashing light that shows which way a car is going to turn."},{"id":"bumper","word":"bumper","pin":[1050,666],"box":[1034,638,32,52],"level":"A2","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈbʌmpə","pos":"noun","ex":"Someone drove into our back bumper.","us":"fender","def":"A bar at the front and back of a car that protects it in a small crash."},{"id":"bonnet","word":"bonnet","pin":[944,512],"box":[862,454,158,116],"level":"A2","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈbɒnɪt","pos":"noun","ex":"Open the bonnet and check the oil.","us":"hood","def":"The cover over the engine at the front of a car."},{"id":"boot","word":"boot","pin":[388,574],"box":[336,562,92,126],"level":"A2","room":"outside","ipa":"buːt","pos":"noun","ex":"Put the shopping in the boot.","us":"trunk","def":"The space at the back of a car for bags and suitcases."},{"id":"windscreen","word":"windscreen","pin":[806,498],"box":[756,444,110,116],"level":"B1","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈwɪndskriːn","pos":"noun","ex":"A stone hit the windscreen and cracked it.","us":"windshield","def":"The big window at the front of a car."},{"id":"wipers","word":"windscreen wipers","pin":[836,540],"box":[816,520,34,40],"level":"B1","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈwɪndskriːn ˌwaɪpəz","pos":"noun","ex":"It's raining - switch on the wipers.","us":"windshield wipers","def":"Thin arms that move across the windscreen to clean off rain."},{"id":"wingmirror","word":"wing mirror","pin":[806,552],"box":[784,536,44,28],"level":"B1","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈwɪŋ ˌmɪrə","pos":"noun","ex":"Check your wing mirror before you change lanes.","us":"side mirror","def":"A mirror on the side of a car, for seeing the cars behind you."},{"id":"doorhandle","word":"door handle","pin":[713,580],"box":[696,572,34,16],"level":"A2","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈdɔː ˌhændl","pos":"noun","ex":"The door handle is broken - open it from the inside.","def":"The part you pull to open a door."},{"id":"rearlight","word":"rear light","pin":[348,614],"box":[336,594,26,40],"level":"B1","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈrɪə laɪt","pos":"noun","ex":"One of your rear lights isn't working.","us":"taillight","def":"A red light at the back of a car."},{"id":"exhaust","word":"exhaust pipe","pin":[330,692],"box":[312,684,48,16],"level":"B1","room":"outside","ipa":"ɪɡˈzɔːst paɪp","pos":"noun","ex":"Smoke was coming out of the exhaust pipe.","us":"tailpipe","def":"The pipe at the back of a car where the smoke from the engine comes out."},{"id":"petrolcap","word":"petrol cap","pin":[402,600],"box":[390,588,24,24],"level":"B1","room":"outside","ipa":"ˈpetrəl kæp","pos":"noun","ex":"Don't forget to close the petrol cap.","us":"gas cap","def":"The small lid on the side of a car where you put in the fuel."},{"id":"seat","word":"seat","pin":[636,560],"box":[602,498,102,136],"level":"A1","room":"inside","ipa":"siːt","pos":"noun","ex":"Can I sit in the front seat?","def":"A thing you sit on. The driver sits in the front seat."},{"id":"backseat","word":"back seat","pin":[488,626],"box":[430,480,114,160],"level":"A2","room":"inside","ipa":"ˌbæk ˈsiːt","pos":"noun","ex":"The children are asleep on the back seat.","def":"The seat behind the driver."},{"id":"headrest","word":"headrest","pin":[638,486],"box":[620,472,36,28],"level":"B1","room":"inside","ipa":"ˈhedrest","pos":"noun","ex":